// Do not hand-edit; re-run the generator.
//
// combinational 5:1 mux (today's RTL) — sound, and 22% too slow.
//
// One transition = one clock edge. Multi-label transitions carry the
// events that coincide in that edge; `accept, grant` is the edge that
// breaks the registered mux. State name S_<loc>_p<ptr>_r<reg>_d<dlv>:
//   loc  IDLE / BUSY  — BUSY = the issue register is presenting to sdram_burst
//   ptr             — the client's address pointer (c_addr)
//   reg             — the address in the fabric's issue register (x = none)
//   dlv             — the address sdram_burst expects next (the oracle)
// DUP / SKIP are absorbing error states; DONE is clean completion.

context MemFabricV1 {
    automata {
